## 2. MAIN PROJECT OBJECTIVES

The existing website has three important UX problems that this redesign must solve.

### Problem 1 — Complicated quote-request form

The existing form requests too much information before visitors can even make an initial inquiry.

Solution:
Create a short, conversion-focused inquiry form that asks only for essential information initially.

### Problem 2 — Underperforming project gallery

The project photographs should do more than simply display completed work.

Solution:
Create an immersive portfolio that encourages visitors to explore projects and request similar work.

### Problem 3 — Repetitive homepage messaging

The homepage must communicate a different purpose in every section.

Solution:
Create a logical storytelling structure that guides visitors from inspiration to trust, project discovery, and finally an inquiry.

