6. Smooth parallax.
7. Animated section dividers.
8. Portfolio hover effects.
9. Animated navigation indicators.
10. Button hover transitions.
11. Smooth lightbox transitions.
12. Animated form interactions.
13. Smooth route transitions.
14. Creative scroll indicators.
15. Subtle image depth effects.

### Creative interactions

Add:
- Image-following previews for service rows on desktop.
- Animated project image masks.
- Large typography reveals.
- Subtle magnetic-feeling buttons.
- Animated lime lines.
- Creative image transitions.

Do not apply every animation to every element.

The motion should feel intentional, smooth, and premium.

### Timing

Micro-interactions: 200–350ms.

Text reveals: 600–900ms.

Image reveals: 800–1200ms.

Section transitions: 500–800ms.

Use smooth easing.

Prefer transform and opacity.

Respect prefers-reduced-motion.

Reduce unnecessary effects on mobile.

